","id":69},{"description":"Touch Only Option","id":77},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Includes level editor","id":17},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","demos":[{"appid":4055930,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this arcade puzzle game you'll use clues to chisel away at stone slabs, revealing hidden images. The numbers on each square tell you how many adjacent squares need to be chiseled. Sometimes you'll need to put marks on the slabwhere you know there's no chiseling to be done before it becomes clear where tochisel next. Repeat the process until the hidden image is revealed.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the game's campaign mode, Follow the story of six museum workers who are tasked with a mission to uncover the mysteries of a cache of slabs found by a local demolitionist.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Prefer a more casual approach? Opt to play all of the puzzles individually at your own pace in the regular puzzle mode.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Test your puzzle solving skills on the world stage in the daily challenge.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Compete with players from around the world for the best time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The over 200 included puzzles provide hours of puzzle solving fun.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use the built-in puzzle editor to create and share puzzles for other players to enjoy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A comprehensive DLC system gives players the power to upload full content packs to extend the game virtually infinitely. From puzzle packs, to new campaigns, avatars, backgrounds, and more, enjoy endless possibilities.</p>","developers":["T CUBED SOFTWARE LLC"],"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3709250/b181629a68f3ac7e624b83b9c583bcdcc7dadacd/he